WEBVTT

00:20:57.663 --> 00:21:00.663
But Matt, we had a little little
sign in between is a picture of

00:21:00.663 --> 00:21:03.329
the two of us in between
both of our offices.

00:21:03.329 --> 00:21:08.121
And someone had put up sticky notes over
each of us and overmatch it, said,

00:21:08.579 --> 00:21:10.246
how do we make it more emotional
and undermines lives,

00:21:10.329 --> 00:21:13.621
how to make it funnier? And there
is a sort of like, you know,

00:21:13.621 --> 00:21:17.579
clearly everyone brings their
whatever their interest is,

00:21:17.579 --> 00:21:20.204
whatever their their point
of view is to the table.

00:21:20.246 --> 00:21:24.704
And even though sometimes it can be
frustrating when someone says, well,

00:21:24.704 --> 00:21:28.496
wait a minute, let's reconsider this,
you know,

00:21:28.538 --> 00:21:30.996
it's almost always a better thing